### ① 正常新增 —— 应该成功
POST http://localhost:8080/book/save
Content-Type: application/json

{"uid":1,"title":"测试书","author":"某人","price":29.9,"status":1}

### ② 书名传空 —— 预期「书名不能为空」
POST http://localhost:8080/book/save
Content-Type: application/json

{"uid":1,"title":"","author":"某人","price":29.9,"status":1}

### ③ 价格传 -1 —— 预期「价格必须大于 0」
POST http://localhost:8080/book/save
Content-Type: application/json

{"uid":1,"title":"测试书","author":"某人","price":-1,"status":1}

### ④ 两个都错 —— 预期「书名不能为空；价格必须大于 0」
POST http://localhost:8080/book/save
Content-Type: application/json

{"uid":1,"title":"","author":"某人","price":-1,"status":1}

### ⑤ 价格不传 —— 预期「价格不能为空」
POST http://localhost:8080/book/save
Content-Type: application/json

{"uid":1,"title":"测试书","author":"某人","status":1}

